    "knowledge_point": "Computing the Limit of a Cosecant Function",
    "problem": "Calculate ${lim}_{x\\to \\pi /3}\\operatorname{csc}⁡(2x).$",
    "worked_solution": "Substituting $x=\\frac{\\pi }{3}$ directly into the limit, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\pi /3}\\operatorname{csc}⁡(2x) & =\\operatorname{csc}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{3})} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
